# Testing

- Use Pest. Unit tests for pure logic (grading, GPA/CGPA, Money, CsvSafe); feature/Livewire tests for flows, policies and services.
- Always test: cross-student isolation, cross-scope staff access, forged callback/notification, duplicate callbacks, payment still pending then confirmed, expired payment, amount mismatch, expired temporary password, import duplicates and re-runs, concurrent matric generation.
- Use factories and fictional data only; never real student data.
- Keep tests deterministic and independent (RefreshDatabase). CI runs against MySQL.
- Run the full relevant suite after each task; fix failures before continuing.
- Tick the matching items in TEST_PLAN.md before marking a task complete.
- Bug fixes include a regression test where practical.
